  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refugee Girls High School Scholarship Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to help Barakat school graduates, our Scholarship Program for High School Girls is working to provide financial backing as well as social support to girls. They in turn will serve as role-models to others in their own Afghan refugee community in Pakistan. The program serves not just to support financially, but also to encourage the girls and their family members with regard to continuing their education. Send these girls to High School.  Give them a boost.</narrative>
  </description>
